Z||000003||AL2||08-03-2001||10:52 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AL:<BR>[B]AL2 you are correct, but it took 16 yrs to do it.30yrs to beat todays SS camaro.[B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>wow, at first i was like; "when did i post that"<BR>i don't fully understand the post.<BR>ok, sound like the pony cars, vs sedan's.<BR>well, as long as they're made (is next year really their last year?) they will be faster than any sedan under $50k.<BR>i mean, i've seen the Z28 for $20k, new, and it'll run mid 13's, easy.||||reg||1
